*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0043
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-04-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 803
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0043.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0043C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WS-FWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MF-AMT             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "WS-FWV=" WS-FWV
    DISPLAY "MF-AMT=" MF-AMT
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 3750 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF AC-A-TY = 'G'
       OR AC-A-TY = 'P'
       OR AC-AB-AMT >= 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FWV
        MOVE 0 TO MF-AMT
    ELSE
        MOVE 7.50 TO MF-AMT
    END-IF.
